WEBVTT

00:00:00.306 --> 00:00:06.112
Reshaping should be driven by the downstream consumer.

00:00:06.112 --> 00:00:13.627
Long form is often more robust for charts, modeling, and changing categories.

00:00:13.627 --> 00:00:18.697
Wide form is useful for fixed business reports and interfaces.

00:00:18.697 --> 00:00:29.687
A good pipeline can keep a reusable long analytical table and create wide presentation outputs only where

00:00:29.687 --> 00:00:38.267
needed. Long and wide are not labels for good and bad design; they are shapes suited to different tasks.

00:00:38.267 --> 00:00:46.202
Long data is often easier for grouping, plotting, and scalable storage.

00:00:46.202 --> 00:00:54.327
Wide data is often convenient for human-readable reports or some modeling interfaces.

00:00:54.327 --> 00:00:58.563
Choose the shape required by the next step.
